WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:02.949
 Watch carefully.

00:00:08.231 --> 00:00:11.520
[SIGH]

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.001
Look at that.

00:00:13.001 --> 00:00:13.500
Oh, boy.

00:00:16.281 --> 00:00:17.030
F****** delicious.

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:20.282
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:23.760
Oh, my Lord.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:26.420
I decided to teach a
second MasterClass.

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:30.420
Oh, boy.

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:33.180
This time around, I'm going
to take you into an area

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:35.360
where you felt your home
cooking could never go.

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:40.830
The secret behind any great
soufflé is in the buttering

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:41.580
of the mold.

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:43.860
You brush vertical strokes up.

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:49.590
This crispy chicken
salad, for me,

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:51.950
is the get out of jail
card, especially when you've

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:54.690
got a big dinner party, because
that is good enough for four

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:55.650
or five of you.

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:56.790
Grab a leaf, lift it up.

00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:04.019
Now, I'm fed up when you
see chefs boiling asparagus.

00:01:04.019 --> 00:01:04.849
Beautiful.

00:01:04.849 --> 00:01:07.890
You get a free facial
at the same time.

00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:09.810
Cooking is a labor of love.

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:11.760
Stay close to every
step of the way.

00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:16.440
I'm going to teach you methods--

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:19.496
secrets-- that I'm teaching some
of the best chefs in the world

00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:19.996
today.

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:26.860
I'm Gordon Ramsay, and
this is my MasterClass.

